    "input": {
      "body": "Hi Alexander,\n\nYour work on property and insurance disputes deserves a more relevant question than the generic PI example I sent. The underlying idea still seems useful: organize the material so you can spend more time evaluating it, with the sources easy to check.\n\nI'm Pranav, founder of Possible Minds. We help PI firms adopt AI, and I'm trying to understand where it would genuinely help before building around assumptions.\n\nWould organizing the document history or identifying missing information be more useful in your matters? Even a brief answer would help, and I'd appreciate your time.\n\nBest,\nPranav\nFounder, Possible Minds",
      "subject": "Re: where AI could compound at Abir Cohen Treyzon Salo, LLP",
